summary:
🚨 Researchers built an AI agent that hacks Salesforce sites on its own. Give it a URL, and it does the rest.

@RecoLabs_ai's Nitay Bachrach showed it maps the site, finds the flaws, writes the exploit, and pulls real data. One unauthenticated request leaked a partner's name, phone, and full billing address. It even scraped LinkedIn to build a target list.

See how 👇https://thehackernews.com/expert-insights/2026/06/hacking-salesforce-sites-with-llm-agent.html
